==English==

===Etymology===
The English form of [[Dorothea]], the name of a legendary ( and possibly fictitious) saint, from {{etyl|grc}} [[δῶρον]], "[[gift]]" + [[θεός]], "[[god]]".

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{given name|female}}.

